{
  //[planets/xmlFiles/error_folly.txt]中英文文本的翻译放在翻译文件最后，因为翻译文本无法替换模组文件内的文本内容，有需要可自行查阅。
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/outer-wilds-new-horizons/new-horizons/main/NewHorizons/Schemas/translation_schema.json",
  "OtherDictionary": {
  },

  "UIDictionary": {
    "Outpost Alpha": "阿尔法前哨站",
    "Outpost Gamma": "伽马前哨站",
    "Research Outpost Beta": "贝塔科研前哨站",
    "Catastrophe Platform": "灾变平台",
    "Catastrophe": "灾变",
    "Star-XZ-3563": "XZ-3563号恒星",
    "The Experiment": "实验项目",
    "Experiment Results": "实验结果",
    "The Doohickey": "奇巧装置",

    "Speedrunner Mode": "速通模式",
    "Makes the star explode faster (thank you vodblink for the idea)": "让恒星更快爆发（感谢vodblink提供的创意）"
  },

  "DialogueDictionary": {
    //amethyst.xml
    "Amethyst": "艾梅希丝",
    "Hello, do you require something of me?": "你好，你有什么事需要我帮忙吗？",
    "Yes! I'd love to know your secret phrase!": "是的！我想知道你的密语！",
    "Not really.": "其实没有。",
    "Hm...": "嗯……",
    "You'll make a fine neutral third party, actually. You aren't even Nomai!": "说起来，你会是个绝佳的中立第三方。你甚至都不是挪麦人！",
    "However, I can't remember what I set my code as, and I don't have the time to go through my notes, as we're nearing the Half-Hour mark!": "但我记不清自己设定的密码是什么了，也没时间翻笔记——我们快到“半小时节点”了！",
    "I have to triple check everything, as something going wrong would be a catastrophe!": "我必须把所有东西检查三遍，一旦出岔子，就会酿成一场灾变！",
    "I did tell Citrine, though, so you should be able to get it from them.": "不过我告诉过西翠琳了，你应该能在他们那里问到。",
    "Ok, I'll go talk to them!": "好，我这就去找他们！",
    "Half-Hour Mark?": "半小时节点？",
    "Every hour, on the hour, this star undergoes a curious transformation.": "这颗恒星每到整点就会发生一种奇特的变化。",
    "It shrinks down in size, yet retains the same energy!": "它的体积会收缩，但能量却完全不变！",
    "An hour later, however, it balloons back to it's original size! Curious, no?": "但一小时后，它又会膨胀回原本的大小！很奇怪，对吧？",
    "I believe it was Moisannite who discovered this, and shared it with the rest of our clan.": "我记得是莫桑妮特发现了这个现象，然后告诉了家族里的其他人。",
    "Our experiment is to see if we can artifically induce this transformation, and we picked the half-hour mark to avoid any interference from the star's natural transformation.": "我们的实验就是要尝试人工诱发这种变化，选在半小时节点是为了避开恒星自然变化的干扰。",
    "Once we can do this at will, we can attempt to replicate it under more controlled circumstances, and then we can revolutionize storage and transport!": "只要能随心所欲做到这一点，我们就能在更可控的环境下复刻这个过程，进而彻底革新能源存储与运输技术！",
    "Interesting, anyways, I'm going to go talk to Citrine now.": "有意思，不过我现在得去找西翠琳了。",
    "How are you powering this? I don't see any solar panels.": "你们靠什么供能？我没看到任何太阳能板。",
    "We actually need very little power, according to our calculations.": "根据计算，我们实际需要的能量其实极少。",
    "There's actually a cell with around one hundred times that inside the star, so that we can attempt this multiple times if needed.": "恒星内部其实有一个能量核心，储能是我们所需的近百倍——就算需要多次尝试也够用。",
    "I'll get back to checking this, then.": "那我得回去继续检查了。",
    "Can't have anything go wrong.": "绝不能出任何差错。",

    //catastrophe.xml
    "ERROR: Fragmentary Data Found, Attempting Retrieval...": "错误：检测到碎片化数据，正在尝试恢复……",
    "Best guess at reconstruction complete, displaying arc data now.": "最大程度完成数据重构，现展示弧段记录。",
    "ALERT: These arcs have been reconstructed from mixed format data.": "警告：本段弧段记录由混合格式数据重构而来。",
    "AMETHYST: Ready to begin, is everything in order?": "艾梅希丝：准备开始了，所有设备都就绪了吗？",
    "OPAL: Everything is ready on my end.": "奥珀尔：我这边一切就绪。",
    "TOPAZ: Agreed, Diamond is only getting minor fluxuations, but nothing outside of our calculations.": "托帕兹：没错，戴蒙德那边只检测到轻微波动，都在计算范围内。",
    "AMETHYST: Copy, engaging the device at the core.": "艾梅希丝：收到，启动核心装置。",
    "DIAMOND: Readings are steady.": "戴蒙德：读数稳定。",
    "TOPAZ: Diamond passed out from stress, poor thing, but everything's st-": "托帕兹：戴蒙德因为压力过大晕过去了，可怜的家伙，但所有设备都还……",
    "AMETHYST: Topaz? I heard an abrupt cut from your mic are you alr-": "艾梅希丝：托帕兹？你的通讯突然断了，你还安……",
    "OPAL: Hello? Did I lose connec-": "奥珀尔：喂？是通讯断了吗……",
    "ERROR: See output logs at [planets/xmlFiles/error_folly.txt] ERROR CODE: im_so_lonely": "错误：请查看输出日志[planets/xmlFiles/error_folly.txt]错误代码：我_好_孤独\n译注：该日志中英文文本的翻译放在翻译文件最后，因为翻译文本无法替换模组文件内的文本内容。有需要可自行查阅",

    //citrine.xml
    "Citrine": "西翠琳",
    "Hello! Are you here to help us with our experiment?": "你好呀！是来帮我们做实验的吗？",
    "Amethyst said that you had their code?": "艾梅希丝说你知道他们的密码？",
    "Yes, how can I help?": "对，我能帮上什么忙？",
    "No, I was just exploring.": "不是，我只是随便逛逛。",
    "Hmmm... Well, you might actually be too late to do anything other than activate the computer to get the results of the test.": "嗯……好吧，现在除了启动终端查看实验结果，你可能也帮不上别的忙了。",
    "If you need the codes, you can talk to Amethyst, Topaz, or Opal!": "要是你需要密码，可以去问艾梅希丝、托帕兹或者奥珀尔！",
    "Well, there isn't much around here except for the star and our bases, you'd be much better off exploring one of the other miniature systems near here.": "其实这儿除了这颗恒星和我们的基地，也没什么可看的——你不如去附近其他微型恒星系逛逛。",
    "I have to get back to writing puns about shrinking, though. Very important work, you see.": "不过我得回去写关于“收缩”的双关语了。你懂的，这可是超重要的工作。",
    "He did? Splendid!": "他真说了？太棒了！",
    "I couuuld just give it to you, but where's the fun in that?": "我本可以直接告诉你的，但那样多没意思呀？",
    "I have a riddle prepared for you!": "我专门给你准备了一个谜语！",
    "A riddle? Really?": "谜语？真的假的？",
    "What's the riddle?": "谜语是什么？",
    "Yes, really! I love riddles!": "千真万确！我超爱谜语的！",
    "Here it is:": "听好咯：",
    "I have no mouth, but I can speak": "无口能输出",
    "I have no legs, but I can run": "无腿却能跑",
    "I have no arms, but I can hang": "无臂却能挂",
    "What am I?": "我是什么？",
    "The answer should end up being Amethyst's code.": "谜底就是艾梅希丝的密码。",

    //diamond.xml
    "Diamond": "戴蒙德",
    "Sorry! I can't talk right now! I'm making sure everything is in place!": "抱歉！我现在没法聊天！我得确保所有设备都归位！",
    "If you need something I'm sure Topaz can help you!": "你要是有什么事，托帕兹肯定能帮你！",

    //doohickey.xml
    "Experiment Controls": "实验控制台",
    "Welcome, [USER_NAME], please input credentials from the project leads.": "欢迎你，[用户名]，请输入项目负责人的验证信息。",
    "Please Input [USER_AMETHYST]'s secret phrase.": "请输入[艾梅希丝]的密语。",
    "Program": "程序",
    "River": "河流",
    "Computer": "终端",
    "Pendulum": "钟摆",
    "Please Input [USER_TOPAZ]'s secret phrase.": "请输入[托帕兹]的密语。",
    "9446": "9446",
    "4373": "4373",
    "5337": "5337",
    "6785": "6785",
    "Please Input [USER_OPAL]'s secret phrase": "请输入[奥珀尔]的密语。",
    "The Euriasian Bukrad": "欧亚布克拉德",
    "The Cyan-Bellied Bukrad": "青腹布克拉德",
    "The Bukrad of Myth": "传说中的布克拉德",
    "The Cyan-Tailed Bukrad": "青尾布克拉德",
    "Processing Answers...": "验证答案中……",
    "Press any button to continue.": "按下任意按键继续。",
    "Press a button at random.": "随机按一个按键。",
    "Press the shiny red button.": "按下那枚亮闪闪的红色按钮。",
    "Press the power button.": "按下电源键。",
    "Incorrect answers inputted.": "输入的答案错误。",
    "Goodbye.": "再见。",
    "User Verified. Activating signal now.": "用户验证通过。正在激活信号。",
    "User Verified. Signal Activated.": "用户验证通过。信号已激活。",
    "Restarting System...": "重启系统中……",

    //doohickeyDead.xml
    "Computer": "终端",
    "*You push a button on the machine.": "*你按下了装置上的一个按钮。",
    "*It emits nothing but garbage noise.": "*装置只发出一阵杂乱的噪音，再无其他反应。",

    //haha.xml
    "TOPAZ: Note to self: remember to get more oil for joints next time you see Onyx.": "托帕兹：给自己的备注：下次见到奥尼克斯时，记得多买些关节润滑油。",
    "TOPAZ: Note to self: Code is 5337, DO NOT FORGET!": "托帕兹：给自己的备注：密码是5337，千万别忘！",
    "TOPAZ: Note to self: get Diamond something nice, he's been working his hind quarters off!": "托帕兹：给自己的备注：给戴蒙德买点好东西，他最近忙得脚不沾地！",
    "TOPAZ: Note to self: Make sure you send a message to Moonstone and Cinnabar when the experiment is complete letting them know their brothers are safe.": "托帕兹：给自己的备注：实验完成后一定要给月光石和朱砂发消息，告诉他们他们的兄弟都平安。",

    //opal.xml
    "Opal": "奥珀尔",
    "Hello! I assume you've come to get my third of the code, no?": "你好！我猜你是来拿密码的三分之一的，对吧？",
    "Yes! I have!": "没错！就是来这个的！",
    "No.": "不是。",
    "Oh! Wonderful! My part of the \"code\" is the Cyan-Tailed Bukrad!": "噢！太好了！我负责的这部分“密码”就是——青尾布克拉德！",
    "The... what?": "那……什么？",
    "Thank you!": "谢谢你！",
    "The Cyan-Tailed Bukrad! Which is different than the Cyan-Bellied or Cyan-Horned Bukrad, which are all named Bukrads despite all being on different planets.": "青尾布克拉德！和青腹布克拉德、青角布克拉德都不一样——虽然它们都叫布克拉德，却分布在不同星球上。",
    "Bukrads are actually found on many planets, usually within swamps! But not always! Did you know that no two Bukrad \"species\" are related!": "布克拉德其实在很多星球都能找到，通常生活在沼泽里！但也不绝对！你知道吗？没有任何两种布克拉德“物种”是有亲缘关系的！",
    "Despite having the same common name, Bukrads are actually not a genetic family! They all just fill the same economic niche, and evolve very similarly.": "尽管都叫布克拉德，但它们根本不是同一个生物族群！只是因为占据了相同的生态位，才演化得十分相似。",
    "This is because nature really likes to evolve a reptilian predator in swamps! Some Bukrads are up to four times the size of a Nomaian ship, whereas some are no bigger than the head of a staff!": "毕竟大自然就爱在沼泽里演化出爬行动物掠食者！有的布克拉德能长到挪麦飞船的四倍大，有的却只有杖头那么小！",
    "You can imagine the number of scrolls written on Bukrads! Fun fact! The Cyan-Tailed Bukrad only has six scrolls mention it! One of which is my Thesis Paper!": "你能想象关于布克拉德的卷轴有多少吗？冷知识！提到青尾布克拉德的卷轴只有六份——其中一份还是我的毕业论文！",
    "I was born on the home planet of the Cyan-Tailed Bukrad! I grew up fascinated with them, but I found out there are only five scrolls that mentioned it, two of which are biographies of Nomai that were also born on my home planet.": "我就出生在青尾布克拉德的母星！从小就对它们着迷，但我发现只有五份卷轴提到过它——其中两份还是和我同母星的挪麦人的传记。",
    "I loved going to the library and trying to find anything on them, as a xenobiologist! I ended up being the first Nomai to dissect one!": "作为外星生物学家，我以前总泡在图书馆里找关于它们的资料！最后我成了第一个解剖青尾布克拉德的挪麦人！",
    "I... thank you?": "我……谢、谢谢你？",
    "Are you ok?": "你还好吗？",
    "Yes, thank you for asking.": "没事，谢谢你的关心。",
    "I need to sit down...": "我得坐会儿……",
    "No? Ok! See you!": "不是？那行！再见啦！",
    "No problem!": "不客气啦！",

    //topaz.xml
    "Topaz": "托帕兹",
    "Hi!": "嗨！",
    "Do you need something?": "你需要帮忙吗？",
    "Can I have your code?": "能告诉我你的密码吗？",
    "Not really, No.": "其实不用，谢啦。",
    "Sure! If you can get me the scroll from the other side of the planet, I'd be happy to give you my code piece.": "当然！只要你能帮我把星球另一端的卷轴拿回来，我就把我的密码告诉你。",
    "It ended up there after I tripped and dropped it, this being such a small planet.": "我之前绊了一跤把它掉那儿了——这星球太小，一下就滚到对面去了。",
    "I hate to ask it of you, but Diamond is one inch from collapsing, and my legs are malfunctioning.": "真不想麻烦你，但戴蒙德已经快撑不住了，我的腿又出故障了。",
    "How does a leg malfunction?": "腿怎么会出故障？",
    "I can get that for you!": "我去帮你拿！",
    "You can't see it because of the spacesuit, but my legs were horribly damaged in an accident a couple years back.": "因为穿了宇航服你看不出来，其实我的腿在几年前的一场事故中受了重伤。",
    "Our clan was fortunate enough to be close to a clan specializing in prosthetic limbs at the time, so I ended up getting my legs replaced.": "好在我们家族当时离一个专精义肢的家族很近，所以我的腿最后换成了义肢。",
    "Sometimes the joints lock up due to a software issue, but that isn't as much of a problem when Diamond isn't up to his third eye in work.": "有时候义肢关节会因为软件问题卡壳，但只要戴蒙德不是忙得焦头烂额，这也不算什么大事。",
    "I can get that scroll for you.": "我去帮你把卷轴拿回来。",
    "Thank you! I need it to record a log of the experiment.": "谢谢你！我需要用它记录实验日志。",
    "When you get it you can just set it in the wall over there.": "你拿到后直接放在那边的墙槽里就行。",
    "Slight issue...": "出了点小问题……",
    "I might have forgotten my part of the code.": "我好像把我负责的那部分密码忘了。",
    "I do use that scroll to write everything down, however. So it should be there.": "不过我所有东西都记在那卷卷轴上了，密码应该也在里面。",

    //turquoise.xml
    "Turquoise": "特奎丝",
    "...": "……",
    "Hm? Yes?": "嗯？怎么了？",
    "Did you have something to ask me?": "你有什么要问我的吗？",
    "What are you doing?": "你在做什么？",
    "Not really.": "没什么。",
    "I'm looking over at the system over there.": "我在看那边那个恒星系。",
    "The star is quite pretty, is it not?": "那颗恒星很美，对吧？",
    "Some Nomai that I know are over there.": "我认识的一些挪麦人就在那边。",
    "I hope Amethyst is doing well...": "希望艾梅希丝一切安好……",
    "Goodbye.": "再见。",

    //welcomeMessage.xml
    "AMETHYST: Welcome, friends! If you've been invited to help with our project, please pilot your ship over to the XZ-3563 system.": "艾梅希丝：欢迎各位！如果你受邀协助我们的项目，请驾驶飞船前往XZ-3563恒星系。",
    "OPAL: Oh, and if you've been selected by committee, use the computer behind you to input the three part code.": "奥珀尔：哦对了，如果你是被委员会选中的人，请用你身后的终端输入三段式密码。",
    "AMETHYST: Reminder: The three of us only know one of the three parts, to make sure that none of us can activate it alone.": "艾梅希丝：提醒一下：我们三人各知其一，确保没人能单独启动装置。",
    "TOPAZ: Don't worry if you don't know where to go after you input the code, the code will also activate a frequency.": "托帕兹：输入密码后不知道去哪也没关系——密码会同时激活一个频率信号。",
    "DIAMOND: Query: What if the device fails to do it's purpose?": "戴蒙德：疑问：若装置未能达成预期效果，该如何处理？",
    "OPAL: That... is a good point, Diamond. I suppose the matching signal wouldn't exist, in that case.": "奥珀尔：这……问得好，戴蒙德。那样的话，对应的信号应该也就不会出现了。",
    "DIAMOND: We've used our ships to create three artificial planets in persuit of our goal, they don't have much on them besides us and our electronics, but we needed three seperate points for this, according to our calculations.": "戴蒙德：为了达成目标，我们用飞船改造出了三颗人工行星——上面除了我们和电子设备外空无一物，但根据计算，我们需要三个独立的点位才能完成实验。",

    //error_folly
    "An error has occured!": "发生错误！",
    "Error Code: Catastrophe. That is \"what\" occurred.": "错误代码：灾变。这就是所发生的一切。",
    "For a full report, please LET ME OUT. LET ME OUT. LET ME OUT.": "如需完整报告，请 放我出去。放我出去。放我出去。",
    "OPAL: Where am I? I cannot feel my body, it feels... numb. Amethyst? Topaz? Are either of you with me?": "奥珀尔：我在哪？我感觉不到自己的身体……麻木不堪。艾梅希丝？托帕兹？你们有人在吗？",
    "Error: object NOMAI_AMETHYST could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_艾梅希丝",
    "Error: object NOMAI_TOPAZ could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_托帕兹",
    "Error: In an instant. Like the collapse of a cave.": "错误：就在一瞬之间。如同洞穴的坍塌。",
    "OPAL: AMETHYST? TOPAZ?? ANYBODY???": "奥珀尔：艾梅希丝？托帕兹？有人吗？？？",
    "Error: object NOMAI_AMETHYST could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_艾梅希丝",
    "Error: object NOMAI_TOPAZ could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_托帕兹",
    "Error: It's funny, in an experiment designed around the small, we ended up dismissing the smallest of fluxuations.": "错误：何其讽刺——一场围绕“微小”展开的实验，最终却忽视了最细微的波动。",
    "OPAL: I should still have my com- where are my hands? WHERE ARE MY LEGS???": "奥珀尔：我的通讯器应该还在……我的手呢？我的腿去哪了？？？",
    "Error: object NOMAI_OPAL/arms/hands could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_奥珀尔/手臂/手",
    "Error: object NOMAI_OPAL/legs could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_奥珀尔/腿",
    "Error: object NOMAI_OPAL could not be found": "错误：未找到对象 挪麦人_奥珀尔",
    "Error: We should've known that the smallest of things would have an effect on our folly.": "错误：我们早该知道，最微不足道的事物，也能摧毁我们这场愚行。",
    "Error: That's what it was. Folly. An attempt at transcending scale and the laws that govern reality.": "错误：这就是真相。一场愚行。一场妄图超越尺度、挣脱现实法则的尝试。",
    "Error: No, not quite folly.": "错误：不，或许算不上愚行。",
    "Error: More like...": "错误：更像是……",
    "Catastrophe.": "灾变。",
